#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Settings.Settings:1
msgid "Centralise les groupes de paramètres de PALM Tracer."
msgstr "Class required for parsing and saving the various PALM Tracer settings."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Settings.Settings:3
